@startuml
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

title Transaction Component L1 - Architecture

package "transaction-api" {
  [TransactionExecutor]
  [TransactionOptions]
  [TransactionContext]
}

package "transaction-core" {
  [DefaultTransactionExecutor]
}

package "transaction-spi" {
  [TransactionProvider]
}

package "transaction-provider-spring" {
  [SpringTransactionProvider]
}

component "PlatformTransactionManager" as PTM
component "DataSourceTransactionManager" as JDBC_TM
component "JpaTransactionManager" as JPA_TM
component "MyBatis Mapper Interface" as MYBATIS_IF
component "DemoRecordMapper.xml" as MYBATIS_XML
component "JPA Repository / EntityManager" as JPA
component "MySQL / PostgreSQL" as DB

TransactionExecutor --> DefaultTransactionExecutor
DefaultTransactionExecutor --> TransactionProvider
SpringTransactionProvider ..|> TransactionProvider
SpringTransactionProvider --> PTM
PTM <|-- JDBC_TM
PTM <|-- JPA_TM
JDBC_TM --> MYBATIS_IF
MYBATIS_IF --> MYBATIS_XML : SQL mapping
MYBATIS_XML --> DB
JPA_TM --> JPA
JPA --> DB

note right of TransactionProvider
SPI 适配事务基础设施，
不是 ORM Adapter。
end note

note bottom of MYBATIS_XML
XML 只定义 SQL。
BEGIN/COMMIT/ROLLBACK
由 Spring TransactionManager 管理。
end note
@enduml
